Bejeweled — WIREPROOF mod

This repository documents and implements an unofficial modification. Bejeweled,
PopCap, EA, and original game code, artwork, audio, and trademarks remain the
property of their respective owners. No affiliation or endorsement is implied.

Packaged artwork, audio, interface resources, and source artwork are included.
The retained native engine is distributed in the release IPA, not as engine source.
Third-party notices accompanying bundled resources are preserved.

The repository includes independently written compatibility/bridge code and small
target-specific patch descriptions. Native addresses and byte guards are tied to
the documented baseline, not a general patch for arbitrary game versions.
